(180506: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Retain%20the%20actual%20original%20identity%20assertion%20profile%20source%20definition%20originalLinkIdentityAssertionProfiles.%20Retain%20the%20frozen%20original%20identity%20policy%20and%20source%20inputs%20together%20with%20every%20authentic%20published%20growth%20control%20and%20exact%20source%20provenance%20in%20an%20additive%20profile-qualified%20assertion%20sidecar.%20The%20immutable%20producer%20policy%20and%20its%20consumers%20are%20not%20repinned.%20Complete%20exact%20source%20encoded%20as%20one%20JSON%20string%3A%20%22const%20originalLinkIdentityAssertionProfiles%3D%7B%5Cn%20schemaVersion%3A1%2Cmodel%3A%27profile-qualified%20original%20link%20identity%20feasibility%20assertions%201%27%2C%5Cn%20frozenSourceInputs%3A%5B%7B%5C%22path%5C%22%3A%5C%22policy.mjs%5C%22%2C%5C%22sha256%5C%22%3A%5C%22080d379c8c97696fb611f841b1d7dba220864e4cd82984febb5c550e7bdd46e5%5C%22%2C%5C%22sourceBytes%5C%22%3A8168%7D%2C%7B%5C%22path%5C%22%3A%5C%22data%2Fpolicy.lino%5C%22%2C%5C%22sha256%5C%22%3A%5C%22c287a0ef8c8eba5a8ee077924fc0f05b306c8e03e44ad0033d4c6f437eb4ed89%5C%22%2C%5C%22sourceBytes%5C%22%3A24703%7D%5D%2C%5Cn%20originalPolicy%3AoriginalLinkIdentityPolicy%2C%5Cn%20publishedGrowthMetadata%3A%7B%5C%22commit%5C%22%3A%5C%22dfe0da8d8d836ec2dbae9d29d6e054b079bdf30e%5C%22%2C%5C%22path%5C%22%3A%5C%22experiments%2Foriginal-link-identity%2Fpolicy.mjs%5C%22%2C%5C%22sourceSha256%5C%22%3A%5C%227ba1588e8e978ccb5e2b97f6b6f06b7e71b5d003701b80d9b08752dc25288c03%5C%22%2C%5C%22sourceBytes%5C%22%3A9161%2C%5C%22growthMetadataSource%5C%22%3A%5C%22%20%20currentGrowth%3A%7Bkind%3A%27type%27%2Creason%3A%27expected%20float%20but%20found%20option%3Aundefined%3Afloat%27%2Cspan%3A%7Bstart%3A165%2Cend%3A177%7D%2C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20observation%3A%27CI%2038911564946%20source-models%20job%20117015296609%20retained%20the%20exact%20identityGrowth%20source%20and%20reported%20this%20earlier%20argument-type%20refusal%20after%20fresh-local%20append%20promotion.%27%2C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20boundary%3A%27The%20original%20unguarded%20words%5Bindex%5D%20read%20remains%20optional.%20Fresh%20append%20admission%20does%20not%20erase%20an%20absent%20element%20or%20prove%20this%20indexed%20loop%20read%20total.%27%7D%2C%5C%5Cn%20%20growthProfiles%3A%5B%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%7Bprofile%3A%27automatic%27%2Cexpected%3A%27currentGrowth%27%2Cprovenance%3A%27The%20original%20CI%20diagnostic%20remains%20the%20active%20automatic-owned%20construction%20refusal.%27%7D%2C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%7Bprofile%3A%27owned%27%2Cexpected%3A%27currentGrowth%27%2Cprovenance%3A%27Explicit%20referenceSemantics%3Afalse%20selects%20the%20same%20owned%20construction%3B%20the%20optional%20read%20remains%20unproved.%27%7D%2C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%7Bprofile%3A%27reference%27%2Cexpected%3A%27growth%27%2Cprovenance%3A%27B46%20retains%20explicit%20reference%20operations%20instead%20of%20privately%20rebinding%20them.%20The%20original%20whole-push%20refusal%20remains%20exact.%27%7D%2C%5C%5Cn%20%20%5D%2C%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%5C%22growthMetadataSha256%5C%22%3A%5C%223bd7cc0d2b5e1335afc7809d6704b3cff91edc0a00d10c9045a0e9650df3525a%5C%22%7D%2C%5Cn%20feasibility%3A%7B%5Cn%20%20growth%3AoriginalLinkIdentityPolicy.feasibility.growth%2C%5Cn%20%20arrayFrom%3AoriginalLinkIdentityPolicy.feasibility.arrayFrom%2C%5Cn%20%20currentGrowth%3A%7Bkind%3A%27type%27%2Creason%3A%27expected%20float%20but%20found%20option%3Aundefined%3Afloat%27%2Cspan%3A%7Bstart%3A165%2Cend%3A177%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20observation%3A%27CI%2038911564946%20source-models%20job%20117015296609%20retained%20the%20exact%20identityGrowth%20source%20and%20reported%20this%20earlier%20argument-type%20refusal%20after%20fresh-local%20append%20promotion.%27%2C%5Cn%20%20%20boundary%3A%27The%20original%20unguarded%20words%5Bindex%5D%20read%20remains%20optional.%20Fresh%20append%20admission%20does%20not%20erase%20an%20absent%20element%20or%20prove%20this%20indexed%20loop%20read%20total.%27%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20growthProfiles%3A%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%7Bprofile%