(186623: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Recognize%20a%20leading%20unary%20negation%20whose%20complete%20selected%20operand%20consumes%20the%20actual%20Rust%20token%20sequence.%20Retain%20balanced%20grouping%20and%20repeated%20negations%2C%20qualified%20names%2C%20calls%2C%20indexing%2C%20member%20access%20and%20the%20question%20operator%3B%20refuse%20binary%2C%20comparison%2C%20cast%2C%20tuple%2C%20assignment%20and%20incomplete%20sequences.%20Comments%20and%20literals%20remain%20opaque%20tokens.%20This%20is%20a%20conservative%20prerequisite%20for%20branch%20inversion%2C%20not%20a%20general%20Rust%20type%20decision.%20Complete%20actual%20source%20encoded%20as%20one%20JSON%20string%3A%20%22export%20function%20acceptRustWholeConditionNegation%28condition%29%20%7B%5Cn%20%20const%20tokens%3Dtokenize%28condition%2C%27Rust%27%29.tokens.filter%28token%3D%3Etoken.kind%21%3D%3D%27eof%27%29%3B%5Cn%20%20if%28tokens%5B0%5D%3F.kind%21%3D%3D%27punct%27%7C%7Ctokens%5B0%5D.value%21%3D%3D%27%21%27%29return%20false%3B%5Cn%20%20const%20matching%3Dnew%20Map%28%29%2Cstack%3D%5B%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20for%28let%20index%3D0%3Bindex%3Ctokens.length%3Bindex%2B%2B%29%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%28tokens%5Bindex%5D.kind%21%3D%3D%27punct%27%29continue%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20value%3Dtokens%5Bindex%5D.value%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%28%5B%27%28%27%2C%27%5B%27%2C%27%7B%27%5D.includes%28value%29%29stack.push%28index%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%20if%28%5B%27%29%27%2C%27%5D%27%2C%27%7D%27%5D.includes%28value%29%29%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20open%3Dstack.pop%28%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20if%28open%3D%3D%3Dundefined%7C%7Ctokens%5Bopen%5D.value%21%3D%3D%28%7B%27%29%27%3A%27%28%27%2C%27%5D%27%3A%27%5B%27%2C%27%7D%27%3A%27%7B%27%7D%29%5Bvalue%5D%29return%20false%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20matching.set%28open%2Cindex%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20if%28stack.length%21%3D%3D0%29return%20false%3B%5Cn%20%20let%20index%3D1%3B%5Cn%20%20while%28tokens%5Bindex%5D%3F.kind%3D%3D%3D%27punct%